    {
      "lore": null,
      "name": "Strategic Knowledge",
      "rules": "▪ This unit’s ranged attacks have <k>[ASSAULT]</k>. \n▪ When this unit is selected to make an <b>advance move</b>, that <b>advance move</b> does not prevent this unit from being <b>eligible to declare a charge</b>. \n▪ When this unit is selected to make a <b>fall-back move</b>, that <b>fall-back move</b> does not prevent this unit from being <b>eligible to shoot</b> and <b>eligible to declare a charge</b>.",
